 "description": "<p>The secretary costume in three pieces: top, hip skirt, and thong, in a milk-silk fabric that feels noticeably smoother than costume polyester. The colorway follows the pictures.</p>\n<p>The hip skirt is the centerpiece - a straight pencil line that reads office until it does not. The top is cut to sit under or over the skirt waistband, and the thong completes the set without visible lines under the skirt.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: milk silk</li>\n<li>Includes: top, hip skirt, thong</li>\n<li>Style: secretary, office romance</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Add a pair of glasses from any convenience store and the costume closes itself.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Milk-silk secretary set with top, hip skirt and thong for office role-play, one size for 40-60 kg.</p>\n",
